            <ArticleTitle>Approximation of the multiplicatives on random multi-normed space.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>204</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1186/s13660-017-1478-9</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this paper, we consider random multi-normed spaces introduced by Dales and Polyakov (Multi-Normed Spaces, 2012). Next, by the fixed point method, we approximate the multiplicatives on these spaces.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
